  "privacyHeroTitle": "Privacy & Security Commitment",
  "privacyHeroSubtitle": "Your personal financial data belongs strictly to you",
  "privacyHeroBody": "Sổ Thu Chi is built on a privacy-first foundation. We only process the data necessary to provide expense tracking and multi-device synchronization, and we never monetize or share your financial records for advertising.",
  "privacySection1Title": "1. Information We Process",
  "privacySection1Item1": "Google Account Profile (when using Cloud Sync): We only receive your display name, email address, and profile photo to identify your account and synchronize your data across devices.",
  "privacySection1Item2": "Guest Mode (Offline): You can use the app locally on your device without providing an email address or any personal identity information.",
  "privacySection1Item3": "User-Entered Financial Records: Includes your ledgers, wallets, income/expense/transfer transactions, monthly budgets, savings goals, debt records, and recurring bills.",
  "privacySection1Item4": "No Bank Credentials Required: Sổ Thu Chi never asks for your bank login credentials, OTP codes, or SMS reading permissions.",
  "privacySection2Title": "2. Data Storage & Protection",
  "privacySection2Item1": "Isolated Cloud Storage: Synced records are stored on Google Cloud Firestore over encrypted TLS connections. Strict security rules ensure only your authenticated account can read or modify your records.",
  "privacySection2Item2": "Offline-First Reliability: Your records are cached locally on your device for instant access without an internet connection and automatically synchronized when back online.",
  "privacySection2Item3": "Biometric App Lock: Fingerprint and facial authentication (Android Biometric / iOS Face ID & Touch ID) are handled strictly by your device hardware; biometric data is never accessed or stored by the app.",
  "privacySection3Title": "3. Zero Ads & No Third-Party Sharing",
  "privacySection3Item1": "Zero Ad Tracking: The application contains no advertisements and embeds no third-party marketing or behavioral tracking SDKs.",
  "privacySection3Item2": "No Data Selling or Sharing: Your financial records, wallet balances, and transaction history are never sold, rented, or shared with any third party.",
  "privacySection4Title": "4. Data Portability & Right to Erasure",
  "privacySection4Item1": "Full CSV Export: You can export your entire transaction history to a standard UTF-8 CSV spreadsheet at any time via Settings > Export Transactions to CSV.",
  "privacySection4Item2": "Instant Account & Data Deletion: You can permanently delete your account and erase all cloud and local records immediately from Settings > Delete Account & All Data.",
